{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "014hid_403_2_4_014_03_09_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2fddc6a4602a128cf66ca5dedf177fed15e8593e3b509080d2acb08e38e582e2",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:014hid_403_2_4_014_03_09_b:2_4_014_03_09_b:cmd-000007:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8553271ae389dd138ffbc00b3d11373b3e93a53c8af03331ea09b565d8dfdf20",
      "text": "喂喂，●●●●プロデューサー？\n你现在在哪儿呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_403_2_4_014_03_09_b:2_4_014_03_09_b:cmd-000009:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0619ebef61964e8d7ad5e7ce841d1285b826f6d322ed155f70eacc6dd132b5e",
      "text": "听说可以品尝刚打好的年糕，\n不介意的话制作人也来吃点怎么样？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_403_2_4_014_03_09_b:2_4_014_03_09_b:cmd-000011:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d18ada90004ca3300167344d46df84137fb94dec443d68de4bac2df4a7276ad1",
      "text": "我就在附近，\n这就过去",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_403_2_4_014_03_09_b:2_4_014_03_09_b:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee598625207857522a75a51c182388014adb34e445ca4beb2157a5bdd5a31dd4",
      "text": "好的！往正面的鸟居这边走，\n闻着香味应该就能找过来了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_403_2_4_014_03_09_b:2_4_014_03_09_b:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e25b86351d82e4416b0344fb2ac46211e43b1c63f8a20b752f8cdc55f29de811",
      "text": "如果找不到地方的话，\n我就去接你，随时跟我说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_403_2_4_014_03_09_b:2_4_014_03_09_b:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14f8abe6575c73133952adf0410d9670478598853c1e7dc2837bd48c88a8e869",
      "text": "我刚才也去参与了打年糕，\n他们还夸我手艺挺不错的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_403_2_4_014_03_09_b:2_4_014_03_09_b:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c6078d02e91f35b640d41e77284d0c3c762aed646a24c1bd91520ae02f7f49e",
      "text": "本以为去神社的人群大批涌来\n是在过了年之后，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_403_2_4_014_03_09_b:2_4_014_03_09_b:cmd-000022:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fcfe4f3e3cb01532895f28f60ffeb53f22d188bcc8a789ca3a83cc293b59df15",
      "text": "没想到这个时期就已经忙着筹备了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_403_2_4_014_03_09_b:2_4_014_03_09_b:cmd-000024:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7f8fe62b9b72ff6818dada09b6427873c4feb52f20f94334a7e1bd82e4a7dc5",
      "text": "经历了挺有意思的事，\n看起来也帮上了忙，真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:014hid_403_2_4_014_03_09_b:2_4_014_03_09_b:cmd-000026:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44a69e45122f6121099981757749aa63c8e117f08f607940b7a725564374dd98",
      "text": "那我在鸟居这边等你。\n趁着难得的热腾腾年糕还没凉，快来吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
